{"title":"1994 AHSME Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>How many of the following are equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/6/7566a2e71bc9e7b863e9bc368f7c4f22ed19e42b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^x+x^x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"58\" height=\"14\" /> for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/e/02e28efa00c4f2c66d1aa381c0cb1f8e0ef8d6e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/c/e0ca4abba039e7da72f36d7e7307e44168988fc5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{I:}\\ 2x^x \\qquad\\textbf{II:}\\ x^{2x} \\qquad\\textbf{III:}\\ (2x)^x \\qquad\\textbf{IV:}\\ (2x)^{2x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"352\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/6/6b612f2e7d03d9dfcc6823d02741b0620b173593.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 0 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 1 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 2 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 3 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"349\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We look at each statement individually.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/0/7401df68d0bb7752322f705f1cdbb3b4c1adc083.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{I:}\\ 2x^x$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"44\" height=\"13\" />. We note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/e/9cec3e63efde6b4644d19fae660ace9bfc83217f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^x+x^x=x^x(1+1)=2x^x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"208\" height=\"18\" />. So statement <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/9/3e9c009d622ad76a8f8dd51d14efb342bdf00c43.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{I}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"7\" height=\"12\" /> is true.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/6/1d6902aa23f3baf55ce8cac7fa81f62179ac6597.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{II:}\\ x^{2x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"50\" height=\"15\" />. We find a counter example which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/5/4c52e02a35db152495396584bfeae1d0599cd753.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/b/7fbc285cbe88325ff731f83e62d917be83967e5f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\neq 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"41\" height=\"17\" />. So statement <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/7/9b7d9ea23c927b5f89556a78ccb5b2dc0c1e0a4c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{II}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"13\" /> is false.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/f/c3f711704fa1478a07d9b4ca797dfb0bcd4bd3da.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{III:}\\ (2x)^x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"74\" height=\"18\" />. We see that this statement is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/a/41a958cf089cb0d2445f5fdc13b49a572796fcfb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^xx^x$\" width=\"35\" height=\"12\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/2/69271b422e022ea65ff1f288eddfcfa82afd8ab7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> is a counter example. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/9/a69bed4520db23e2a1e4408b031b8a7c8865eb12.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8\\neq 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"53\" height=\"18\" />. So statement <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/6/6a67b566416e3dee397c1f10d1bd2c7e2690f1ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{III}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"22\" height=\"12\" /> is false.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/6/626b9dd6d138cd9e9f4b94c39506fec088a84f42.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{IV:}\\ (2x)^{2x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"79\" height=\"19\" />. We see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/5/4c52e02a35db152495396584bfeae1d0599cd753.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> is again a counter example. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/9/9195a80d02cdb03bcd332430a7fa7d650961aef2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\neq 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"42\" height=\"17\" />. So statement <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/d/b6d770db375c7a27b9c2c3674264ef69aacaa436.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{IV}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"21\" height=\"12\" /> is false.\n</p><p>Therefore, our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/e/75e101201addd96f637069ef5899fa2b44223efc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B) }1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"55\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p><p>--Solution by <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=200685\">TheMaskedMagician</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME\" title=\"1994 AHSME\">1994 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1994 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1994 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1994\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1994 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1994 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1994 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1994 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1994 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1994 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1994 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1994 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8